{"type":"item.completed","item":{"id":"item_0","type":"agent_message","text":"```systemverilog\nmodule rotating_owner (\n    input  logic clk,\n    input  logic rst_n,\n    input  logic req0,\n    input  logic req1,\n    input  logic retire,\n    output logic grant0,\n    output logic grant1\n);\n\n    logic prefer1;\n\n    always_ff @(posedge clk or negedge rst_n) begin\n        if (!rst_n) begin\n            grant0  <= 1'b0;\n            grant1  <= 1'b0;\n            prefer1 <= 1'b0;\n        end else if (grant0 && retire) begin\n            prefer1 <= 1'b1;\n            grant0  <= req0 && !req1;\n            grant1  <= req1;\n        end else if (grant1 && retire) begin\n            prefer1 <= 1'b0;\n            grant0  <= req0;\n            grant1  <= req1 && !req0;\n        end else if (!grant0 && !grant1) begin\n            if (req0 && req1) begin\n                grant0 <= !prefer1;\n                grant1 <= prefer1;\n            end else begin\n                grant0 <= req0;\n                grant1 <= req1;\n            end\n        end\n    end\n\nendmodule\n```"}}
